## Why This Is Asked
This evaluates expertise in deploying real-time ML systems within AWS for privacy-sensitive, multi-tenant environments requiring comprehensive monitoring, explainability, and rapid recovery capabilities.

## Key Concepts
- AWS PrivateLink and SageMaker endpoint architecture
- Private data lake integration with strict multi-tenant isolation
- Real-time drift detection and SHAP/IG explainability frameworks
- Provisioned concurrency and autoscaling for performance targets

## Code Example
```javascript
// Explainer integration for inference transparency
function explainInference(model, input, featureNames) {
  const shapValues = model.predictSHAP(input);
  const igValues = model.predictIntegratedGradients(input);
  return {
    prediction: model.predict(input),
    explanations: {
      shap: shapValues,
      integratedGradients: igValues,
      featureNames: featureNames
    },
    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
    tenantId: extractTenantId(input)
  };
}
```

